{"1829520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Powerlust", "steam_appid": 1829520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No rigid classes</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/a91602ba3be23381df449bc74cb71429.poster.avif?t=1753956459\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/a91602ba3be23381df449bc74cb71429.webm?t=1753956459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/a91602ba3be23381df449bc74cb71429.mp4?t=1753956459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You can create <strong>your own class</strong>, nothing is locked, feel free to play as a fire mage wielding a two handed sword or a necro archer.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tons of masteries and skills</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/7820c9c47664aaf8640f05bbd129cbae.poster.avif?t=1753956459\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/7820c9c47664aaf8640f05bbd129cbae.webm?t=1753956459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/7820c9c47664aaf8640f05bbd129cbae.mp4?t=1753956459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>There is a vast number of options to choose from when it comes to spells, weapons, abilities and masteries. You can create a ton of builds and constantly find new ways of crushing your enemies!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Old school action RPG hack and slash with skill based combat.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/05cfbfbf3d4715ec818cc926e9ed8892.poster.avif?t=1753956459\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/05cfbfbf3d4715ec818cc926e9ed8892.webm?t=1753956459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/05cfbfbf3d4715ec818cc926e9ed8892.mp4?t=1753956459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Stats are important, but so is evading enemy attacks and aiming yours!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open world full of quests</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/d7931498d0542415c8b5be5f254056cd.avif?t=1753956459\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br>Explore the world of Powerlust, travel between cities, find amazing treasures, help npcs find their lost teeth and more!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made by one guy</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/f153c4b3ed043306b0ed99b88f2e7069.poster.avif?t=1753956459\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/f153c4b3ed043306b0ed99b88f2e7069.webm?t=1753956459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/f153c4b3ed043306b0ed99b88f2e7069.mp4?t=1753956459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Hobby project made by one guy (me). I spent quite a few years on it already. No huge corporations involved :)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fun camera mods</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/dfb6948ee7609ccf85138b6401cb0910.poster.avif?t=1753956459\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/dfb6948ee7609ccf85138b6401cb0910.webm?t=1753956459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/dfb6948ee7609ccf85138b6401cb0910.mp4?t=1753956459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Choose the way you play between Isometric, Top Down, TPP and FPP camera modes! Use fun camera filters to make the game look unique.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I'd love to hear your feedback</h2>I'm still working on this game. I'd appreciate any feedback, it will be a really huge help in further development. Check out my twitter for constant updates and share your thoughts via email or <strong>discord</strong>!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Procedurally generated dungeons.       <br></li><li>Skill-based combat.       <br></li><li>No rigid classes.       <br></li><li>Tons of masteries, items, skills and builds.       <br></li><li>Open world to explore.       <br></li><li>Optional permadeath.       <br></li><li>Controller support.     <br></li><li>Awesome discord community.</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No rigid classes</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/a91602ba3be23381df449bc74cb71429.poster.avif?t=1753956459\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/a91602ba3be23381df449bc74cb71429.webm?t=1753956459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/a91602ba3be23381df449bc74cb71429.mp4?t=1753956459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You can create <strong>your own class</strong>, nothing is locked, feel free to play as a fire mage wielding a two handed sword or a necro archer.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tons of masteries and skills</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/7820c9c47664aaf8640f05bbd129cbae.poster.avif?t=1753956459\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/7820c9c47664aaf8640f05bbd129cbae.webm?t=1753956459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/7820c9c47664aaf8640f05bbd129cbae.mp4?t=1753956459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>There is a vast number of options to choose from when it comes to spells, weapons, abilities and masteries. You can create a ton of builds and constantly find new ways of crushing your enemies!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Old school action RPG hack and slash with skill based combat.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/05cfbfbf3d4715ec818cc926e9ed8892.poster.avif?t=1753956459\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/05cfbfbf3d4715ec818cc926e9ed8892.webm?t=1753956459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/05cfbfbf3d4715ec818cc926e9ed8892.mp4?t=1753956459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Stats are important, but so is evading enemy attacks and aiming yours!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open world full of quests</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/d7931498d0542415c8b5be5f254056cd.avif?t=1753956459\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br>Explore the world of Powerlust, travel between cities, find amazing treasures, help npcs find their lost teeth and more!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made by one guy</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/f153c4b3ed043306b0ed99b88f2e7069.poster.avif?t=1753956459\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/f153c4b3ed043306b0ed99b88f2e7069.webm?t=1753956459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/f153c4b3ed043306b0ed99b88f2e7069.mp4?t=1753956459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Hobby project made by one guy (me). I spent quite a few years on it already. No huge corporations involved :)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fun camera mods</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/dfb6948ee7609ccf85138b6401cb0910.poster.avif?t=1753956459\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/dfb6948ee7609ccf85138b6401cb0910.webm?t=1753956459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/extras/dfb6948ee7609ccf85138b6401cb0910.mp4?t=1753956459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Choose the way you play between Isometric, Top Down, TPP and FPP camera modes! Use fun camera filters to make the game look unique.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I'd love to hear your feedback</h2>I'm still working on this game. I'd appreciate any feedback, it will be a really huge help in further development. Check out my twitter for constant updates and share your thoughts via email or <strong>discord</strong>!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Procedurally generated dungeons.       <br></li><li>Skill-based combat.       <br></li><li>No rigid classes.       <br></li><li>Tons of masteries, items, skills and builds.       <br></li><li>Open world to explore.       <br></li><li>Optional permadeath.       <br></li><li>Controller support.     <br></li><li>Awesome discord community.</li></ul>", "short_description": "Old school action RPG. Travel through an open world, design your own character class and feed your LUST for POWER by crushing your foes. Bonus replayability thanks to procedural generation, tons of abilities and items. Optional permadeath for hardcore roguelike fans!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Vietnamese, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/2fae1f5220cd4dba127806df6d48bacc32c5d8f0/header.jpg?t=1753956459", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/57b26f0abd2665be7700b5cabbb6b85057099467/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753956459", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829520/57b26f0abd2665be7700b5cabbb6b85057099467/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753956459", "website": "https://bartmamzer.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core CPU @ 2GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 650 or Radeon HD 7750 with a minimum of 1GB of VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2000 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br